      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那也是，我才要说的……！我也非常惊讶……同时也十分感动。\n没想到在东京的学园里也有这样的人啊，我想着——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f99697db1b498f59663f7d6910604a7cf7dfe06a6ab77a7573370999bb755b4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
