    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbd53d05cc8d80e9080927d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那次之后成为了契机，我才能多次有幸和勇心前辈\n一起进行山间训练……这真的是，无可替代的相遇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "444f05e0c8303fb5f8763d93833b16d673503999126d855d56f7d83f21d07c2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:584ca3879039eb54ebb30711",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fadc77161fca157636199c69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是吗？\n那一天获得了无可替代的相遇的人，其实是我才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3be0b23f995b18b65649ba8f34bf5563475e3f1986961faebaca39ad9dae18d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d64ce5e111c8c9efac0e9d8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb9e37b5b58dc5653cac80e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——我呢。其实那个时候……在某个活动的表演赛上，\n被同届的对手们彻彻底底地打败了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a25692dfdfb2045645b2ff62fe47dc67ee117d335849d16d851646a418aa869",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9351c426a1b44e2989eefb7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ace60725f8712e1c85aa4e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是一次又一次，被迫注视着她们远去的背影，\n那一次又再次深深刻在了我的脑海里呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcd84e8e5a320db01aa326051b407be421d8aa6b128d2eecb0f5ad91a141fcd8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99e7a12dcc82d1d3d173a17e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27e1f21076b9823fa0b4c035",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在四个人当中，在比赛最前线坚持跑了最久的是我。\n正因为有着这份自负——所以还是觉得有点，难以忍受呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "147f7099f58f4dd40b04a490147ae564a0b5c8dd8d751e9a2abad3eecd81cfb9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f133a9fec60bdd407477766",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d6c31e59155d24b5497306",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，只有重新站起来的意志我不想失去。我不想就此屈服。\n于是，几乎是带着赌气的心情前往的那个地方——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7294fe47b45c724c3e43130b012ad390e6a298bdd0827a2dbfbd288d8eb6ac6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee444e79a3e136d67cf5b01f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
