    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3a25107afa6920ae94873e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——等待着我的，就是与你的相遇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43d5dcc3ab8e293c3cb44431c2c5760b69983548591420b7f170397447b7a98e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f53aee66fd4dfdee95d20e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b41e2ff7ee6e62c1a4cf8a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊啊！？营地——变得乱七八糟了……！？\n帐篷也被弄破了……食物也——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e695f4f45f8cd8c20e8bd85ad0b2c7627c695e4c39b0090eb50ca8ed64e96f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/09/0052/storytimeline_090052005.json",
      "json_path": [
